  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116488",
      "title": "Reloading Pages via the Angular Router & Configuring Programmatic Navigation",
      "lectureOrder": 300,
      "videoOrder": 285,
      "sourceHash": "40ed4cad2ccbbac9f7e9aed9c5db64f641e22e9a05603980534fdd64ec99c520",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 2.67,
          "en": "At the moment in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "whenever I click complete here on one of my tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 9.15,
          "en": "it doesn't update the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.15,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "If I reload, I can tell that the task actually was deleted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.563,
          "en": "but that's not shown immediately when I click complete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that when a task is removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "this resolver, which loads my tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.92,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "does not execute again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.41,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "because keep in mind that it's this resolver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 33.6,
          "en": "that loads the user tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.6,
          "end": 36.99,
          "en": "that are then made available to the task's component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.99,
          "end": 39.423,
          "en": "through this user task's input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 43.26,
          "en": "So if this resolver doesn't run again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "it's still the old list of tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "that's output by this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 51.633,
          "en": "and that includes the task I deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.71,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "Now, that's of course not the behavior I want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "and therefore one thing we could do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 62.19,
          "en": "is go to the task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.19,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "where I do trigger the task removal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 68.973,
          "en": "and also initialize a navigation action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 73.32,
          "en": "For that, we can inject the angular router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 77.013,
          "en": "to perform some programmatic navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 80.34,
          "en": "So I'll inject the router, and for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.34,
          "end": 82.65299999999999,
          "en": "of course the router must be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.73,
          "en": "And with that, here in on complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "we can use this router to call navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 93.03,
          "en": "Now, navigate then can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.03,
          "end": 96.18,
          "en": "with an array of route fragments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 99.42,
          "en": "where the first and only fragment in my case here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.42,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "could be such a relative route fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 104.583,
          "en": "So such a relative path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.50999999999999,
          "end": 107.13,
          "en": "which should hopefully lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.13,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "to the same route being loaded again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 112.773,
          "en": "which hopefully leads to the resolver to run again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 116.733,
          "en": "But this is actually not how it would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.63,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "Instead, we need to add some configuration options here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 123.66,
          "en": "to make this navigation action work correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 125.04,
          "en": "And then we'll also need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 127.68,
          "en": "to tweak some other place in this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.68,
          "end": 129.09,
          "en": "because one option we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.09,
          "end": 132.9,
          "en": "to add here in this navigate configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.9,
          "end": 137.22,
          "en": "is the relative to property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "Because to make sure that Angular navigates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "relative to the route we're currently on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "with this Navigate method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "you must tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "that you want to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "relative to the currently activated route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "And you do this by providing the relative to property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "and by then injecting the activated route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 163.653,
          "en": "as we did it before in other parts of this section as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.63,
          "end": 170.63,
          "en": "So the activated route must be imported and injected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "And then here you said relative to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 176.73,
          "en": "to this activated route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 178.023,
          "en": "But that's not all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 180.93,
          "en": "In addition, you should also set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.93,
          "end": 185.93,
          "en": "the on same URL navigation to reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.36,
          "end": 189.33,
          "en": "because since I'm essentially telling Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.33,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "that I want to go to the route I'm currently on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 195.39,
          "en": "by default, it would ignore that navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 198,
          "en": "and it would not trigger resolvers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198,
          "end": 199.473,
          "en": "or anything like that again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 202.353,
          "en": "So we must set this to reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.353,
          "end": 206.94,
          "en": "to get Angular to perform this navigation action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 209.703,
          "en": "as if we would be coming from a different route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "But even with this all added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "we would still not get the behavior we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 218.73,
          "en": "Because in addition, you also need to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.73,
          "end": 221.31,
          "en": "to the user routes configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.31,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "And then there on this route config for this task route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 231.07999999999998,
          "en": "you should change run guards and resolvers to always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "because otherwise Angular would actually not run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "this resolver function here again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 239.88,
          "en": "because never the path parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.88,
          "end": 242.91,
          "en": "nor the query parameters changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.91,
          "end": 245.37,
          "en": "That's why we need always here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.37,
          "end": 247.11,
          "en": "Well, and with that, finally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.11,
          "end": 249.513,
          "en": "if you save that, if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 255.8,
          "en": "and I will actually disable this guard here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 256.44,
          "end": 258.39,
          "en": "and set this to one to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 258.39,
          "end": 260.85,
          "en": "that we always end up on this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.85,
          "end": 261.683,
          "en": "where I want to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.683,
          "end": 264.27,
          "en": "to since it's a bit annoying otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.27,
          "end": 266.04,
          "en": "So with that, if I go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.04,
          "end": 269.49,
          "en": "if I sort here, that works as intended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.49,
          "end": 271.47,
          "en": "But if I now click complete here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.47,
          "end": 273.78,
          "en": "you see that was updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.78,
          "end": 275.97,
          "en": "So that now worked as intended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "due to those settings we added to this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 283.26,
          "en": "Now, one problem you might still notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.26,
          "end": 287.34000000000003,
          "en": "is that if you do actually add another task here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.34000000000003,
          "end": 289.29,
          "en": "if you do sort",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.29,
          "end": 292.02,
          "en": "and you therefore have query parameters here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.02,
          "end": 295.53,
          "en": "if you sort and you then click complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.53,
          "end": 298.713,
          "en": "those query parameters are actually deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 300.39,
          "end": 302.82,
          "en": "And to make sure that this is not happening,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.82,
          "end": 307.38,
          "en": "we should add one last option here to this navigate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 307.38,
          "end": 309.87,
          "en": "And that's the queryParamsHandling option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.87,
          "end": 311.83,
          "en": "which you should set to preserve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 316.443,
          "en": "to make sure that query parameters are preserved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 318.69,
          "end": 320.91,
          "en": "With that, finally, if you go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.91,
          "end": 324.58,
          "en": "and you add one more test here real quick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.62,
          "end": 330.18,
          "en": "and you click on sort so that you have query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.18,
          "end": 331.29,
          "en": "Now if you do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 331.29,
          "end": 332.94,
          "en": "and you click on complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 332.94,
          "end": 334.65,
          "en": "you see the page updates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 334.65,
          "end": 337.47,
          "en": "because the route is kind of reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.47,
          "end": 340.8,
          "en": "and the query parameters are also still there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 340.8,
          "end": 344.763,
          "en": "And that's now the behavior I want for this application.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
